@title INC-3107 EU Matchmaking DNS Outage
@subtitle Postmortem, Alder Cloud Games
@author Network team
@date 2026-08-19

kpi Duration | 1 h 52 min
kpi Lowest success rate | 61.3% | | bad
kpi Matches failed | 48,200 | | bad
kpi Region | EU-West

## What happened

A Terraform change replaced the weighted DNS records for `match.eu` with a single record pointing at a decommissioned load balancer, so players in Europe could not reach matchmaking. The record was restored at 10:11, but resolvers had negatively cached the failures with a TTL of 3600 seconds, which kept matches failing for close to an hour after the fix.

